General_SiSo_Auto_LTE_PRACH_Performance_Test_Model_Activation_Admin
    [Documentation]
    ...  Activates and validates results of LTE PRACH Performance Test Model via admin API. Version for TDD and FDD radios.
    ...  Test result validation relies on timeReceived value and parameters name check in every frame of results.
    ...
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : Global cell id of tested LTE cell or IoT inband/guardband/standalone cell, e.g. 1.
    ...  :param int rep_time_interval: (Optional) : reporting time interval (in seconds), range <0 to 4294967295>, defaults to 1.
    ...  :param int subcarrier_offset: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, defaults to None means parameter will not be set in test.
    ...  :param int num_subcarriers: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, defaults to None means parameter will not be set in test.
    ...  :param int nb_repetitions: (Optional) : parameteequired r required to start test model on narrowband IoT cell. One of the following: 'NBR_8', 'NBR_32' or None,
    ...                                          defaults to None means parameter will not be set in test.
    ...  :param int nb_subframe_offset: (Optional) : narrowband IoT subframe offset, range <0 to 255>, defaults to 0.
    ...  :param int config_index: (Optional) : required to start test model, range <0 to 2>, defaults to 0.
    ...  :param int preamble_index: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <0 to 47>, defaults to 7.
    ...  :param int accepted_timing_error: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <0 to 65535>, defaults to 10000.
    ...  :param int constant_offset: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <0 to 65535>, defaults to 10000.
    ...  :param int reception_subframe: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <0 to 1023>, defaults to 0.
    ...  :param int exception_subframe: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <0 to 1023>, defaults to 0.
    ...  :param int reception_bundle: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <1 to 31>, defaults to 1.
    ...  :param int expection_bundle: (Optional) : parameter required to start test model, range <1 to 31>, defaults to 0.
    ...  :param int tdd_spec_subf_conf: (Optional) : parameter required for TDD configuration, range <3 to 9>, defaults to 7.
    ...                                              Parameter is not taken into account in case of FDD configuration.
    ...  :param int tdd_frame_conf: (Optional) : parameter required for TDD configuration, range <1 to 3>, defaults to 1.
    ...                                          Parameter is not taken into account in case of FDD configuration.
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for test startup and termination, defaults to 90.

    [Arguments]                                             ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${rep_time_interval}=1
    ...                                                     ${subcarrier_offset}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${num_subcarriers}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${nb_repetitions}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${nb_subframe_offset}=0
    ...                                                     ${config_index}=0
    ...                                                     ${preamble_index}=7
    ...                                                     ${accepted_timing_error}=10000
    ...                                                     ${constant_offset}=10000
    ...                                                     ${reception_subframe}=0
